### ==============================================================================
### SizzleSpoon API Interactive Requests (VS Code REST Client)
### Install extension: "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
### Click "Send Request" above any query to test!
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/

### 2. Get All Recipes (Limit 24)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes?limit=24

### 3. Search 100% Halal Recipes by Keyword (e.g., "butter", "chicken", "paneer")
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes?search=butter

### 4. Search by Cuisine (e.g., "French", "Indian", "Chinese", "Italian")
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes?search=French

### 5. Get All Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### 6. Get Single Recipe Details (ID: 12 - Butter Chicken)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes/12

### 7. Get Single Recipe Details (ID: 15 - Dim Sum Dumplings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes/15

### 8. Get Single Recipe Details (ID: 16 - French Beef Bourguignon)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes/16

### 9. Get Single Recipe Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/12
